OL,5,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,6,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,7,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,8,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,9,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,10,     Feverything in between.
OL,11,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,12,     FSoweto presents highlights from
OL,13,     Fthis year's Jazzahead in Bremen,
OL,14,     FGermany. Tonight, we hear from
OL,15,     Ftrombonist Nabou Claerhout and a
OL,16,     Flive track from her set.
OL,17,G0030 Through the Night
OL,18,     FOle Edvard Antonsen delivers
OL,19,     FTrumpet Concertos by Haydn and
OL,20,     FTartini. He's accompanied by the
OL,21,     FArgovia Philharmonic conducted by
OL,22,     FRune Bergmann.
